WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:08.476
Parents, short AI videos can help at home: homework songs and story videos you make together. Never upload your child's photo.

2
00:00:09.226 --> 00:00:13.500
Step 1. Pick one topic from this week's homework.

3
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.532
Step 2. Make a short song or story video together with a free tool.

4
00:00:20.282 --> 00:00:24.916
Step 3. Watch it together and talk about what you learned.

5
00:00:25.666 --> 00:00:30.060
What to do next? Next, see Teach Kids with AI.
